Subject: [PATCH 3/3] scripts: cargt: shared-table generator for multi-DDR
 boards, EEPROM host test

- cargt_ddr_merge.py: turns DDR Tool timing files into one shared
  trained-CSR list and PIE table plus per-configuration files, and checks
  that each configuration reproduces its original tables.
- test/run_eeprom_test.sh: host test of oei/ddr/cargt_eeprom.c against
  records built like the ATE writes them.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Cargt board specific]
